(
 '# Methods'
 ''
 'Note that `Input` offers way more public methods than listed here. The reason for that is that many functions need'
 'to be publicly available for technical reasons. All the callbacks are an example: without them being public they'
 'would not be found and therefore not executed.'
 ''
 'Here we list just those functions that can be meaningful used by the user.'
 ''
 'For this reasons there is a function `PublicMethods` available: it lists just what''s important for the user.'
)
